  unitName: Xenon
  unitId: 860013
  unitNumber: 8018
  description: An orphan found and adopted by Learyl who went on to become commander
    of the Elysian Army. He started working for the royal family as Princess Estia's
    playmate and pageboy. With the swordsmanship Learyl taught him, Xenon was selected
    to join the royal army at the tender age of 15. He swore to dedicate his life
    and skills to the kingdom that gave him a home.
  summonDesc: My name is Xenon. I fight for Elysia. Where do you hail from?
  fusionDesc: There's much more to be mastered.<br>I'm not satisfied just yet.
